	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. Scripsi superioribus diebus, reverende in
					<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Christo pater, et spero tibi meos redditar
					<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Sed et illas prolixas te accepisse puto, quae semer
					<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>cum illis, quae scribebantur ad senatum vestrum
					<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>interciderunt, affirmat ille tabellio se
					<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Belzingere dedisse, si in illis videor nimis
					<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>querulus egnosse pro tua paterna indulti
					<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ntiaVides has turbas et toties recursantes
					<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>motum me ita distrahere, ut intridum
					<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ubivis potius esse mulim, qua hic ubi sum
					<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>videbantur nostri per motus paultim conquescore,
					<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>sed feri nunciatur, omnia in dies turbulentior
					<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Superverit mercator, qui affirmat
					<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Hispanicum legatum reverti et lomumusque
					<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>rogressum seque, si diutius expectare potuisset,
					<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>simul lacum transiturum fuisse. Haec, si veru
					<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>sunt, vides quom aucipiti malo distineamur.
					<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Procul dubie harum turbarum authoris, ad eum
					<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>hęc omnia perscripserint et denuo evocerunt
					<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Sic illi, qui omnibus volunt principibus reriuntiore
					<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>hic obviis ulcis excipient. Sic vides
					<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>miserum horum rgionum statum. Spc te saluto
					<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>scire volui. Vale, reverende in Christo pater.
					<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Hic omnia rigent gela, quod tantum est, quantum
					<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>non fit tota hyeme iteque roga d. consulem
					<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>brevem moam boni consulatnnt
					<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>in via corrumperetur.
					<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Curu et de aliusque
					<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>1555.
					<pb/>
					<lb xml:id="p2z1"/>implissimo viro d. Heinrycho
					<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero, domino
					<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>suo et in Christo
					<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>patri venerendo.
					<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Zurich a H. Bullinger,
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
